  (text "4 / 8 / 16 ohm taps through a rotary" (at 367.336 142.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "605286e9-a0b5-4bdb-87b2-698ab4a065c1"))
  (text "selector; feedback off the 16 ohm tap." (at 367.336 146.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "11cf94a2-a4de-4484-a403-33920326da5b"))
  (text "Two EL34s per phase in parallel push-pull, each with its own 22 k grid stopper and 100 ohm screen stopper;" (at 301.336 226.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "e90c6188-f82c-4032-b460-fed3048a3a43"))
  (text "one 100 k grid leak serves each pair. The screens run off their own 470 ohm feed, below the plate rail." (at 301.336 230.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "4c5990f0-8d77-4dcd-862d-fdd30c1d5d12"))
  (text "Power — mains transformer with 100 / 117.5 / 225 / 250 V primary taps (omitted); silicon bridge of four UF5408s; a series-pair 220 uF reservoir bank with 220 k sharing resistors;" (at 21.336 208.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "3ad55b0e-075e-4c78-bde2-3bd5a6f85595"))
  (text "100 ohm / 1 k / 47 k / 22 k rail droppers, and a 470 ohm feed to the EL34 screens. C19 is a two-section 50 uF can in one housing: RB5 and RB6 balance its halves, and their junction is the can's mid-point." (at 21.336 213.278 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left)) (uuid "a1075a5c-64a2-4f07-8801-2de0c3ad09b7"))
